  "description": "The Cornerstone is a prestigious new residential development in the dynamic heart of Stillorgan Village - an area with your lifestyle in mind. With the well-known Stillorgan Village Shopping Centre adjacent to the scheme, it has a range of amenities from department stores and boutiques to cafés and restaurants.  \r\nGetting to The Cornerstone couldn’t be easier. We are right on the N11 with a Quality Bus Corridor which means you can be in the City Centre in less than 30 minutes. Aircoach provides a direct link to Dublin Airport via the city centre. There is ample basement parking and a place to park your bike or E Bike or E-Scooter. Blackrock Village, Dun Laoghaire seafront and Dundrum Town Centre are all less than 20-minute drive.\r\nOur two-bedroom apartments are carefully crafted with high-end finishes and thoughtful touches. Cook up a storm with state-of-the-art kitchen appliances. Unwind in airy living spaces flooded with natural light and floor to ceiling windows. Feel at home with warm lamps and soft rugs - each detail is tailored to enhance your living experience.  In selected apartments you can also avail of unrivalled vista across Dublin Bay.\r\nFinished to the highest specification, our apartments have the following features:\r\n\r\n•\tFloor-to-ceiling windows\r\n•\tBespoke, high-quality interior finishes\r\n•\tNewly-furnished with high quality contemporary furniture and fittings by MJF Interiors\r\n•\tFully-integrated kitchen units with high quality appliances \r\n•\tSeparate utility room\r\n•\tPlenty of storage\r\n•\tWood flooring throughout\r\n•\tMobile video entry security system\r\n•\tWiring for phone, cable and super-fast broadband\r\n•\tEfficient central heating system with App controls\r\n\r\nOur spacious, modern resident amenities area is best in class with:\r\n•\tLounge areas\r\n•\tCommunal kitchen\r\n•\tLarge games and cinema room\r\n•\tBusiness centre\r\n•\tGym\r\n•\tChildren's playroom and private outdoor playground\r\n\r\nAdditional amenities you’ll find exclusively at The Cornerstone include:\r\n•\tPrivate landscaped courtyard\r\n•\tRoof terrace\r\n•\tTouchless entry for each apartment\r\n•\tBespoke resident’s app\r\n•\tDog washing facility\r\n•\tBasement parking including EV parking spaces\r\n•\tSecure bicycle parking with facility to service bikes\r\n•\tMyPup parcel lockers\r\n•\tAnnual resident events hosted by the on-site management team\r\n•\tYuko Car Sharing\r\n\r\nFor all available information, please visit: https://www.thecornerstone.ie/.",
